  "post_content": "<p>La Diputaci&oacute;n de Castell&oacute;n realiza este jueves tres jornadas t&eacute;cnicas, una de elllas en el Local de Asociaciones en La Safona de Onda, dirigidas a pol&iacute;ticos y t&eacute;cnicos municipales, en las que se explica el funcionamiento del Servicio Provincial de Asistencia a Municipios (SEPAM), el Plan de Modernizaci&oacute;n Administrativa y el nuevo Plan Provincial de Obras y Servicios (POYS) bianual, que se aprobar&aacute; ma&ntilde;ana viernes en el Pleno de la Corporaci&oacute;n Provincial.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadasepamdipu/img_7264.jpg\" alt=\"img_7264\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadasepamdipu/img_7265.jpg\" alt=\"img_7265\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadasepamdipu/img_7266.jpg\" alt=\"img_7266\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadasepamdipu/img_7268.jpg\" alt=\"img_7268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadasepamdipu/img_7269.jpg\" alt=\"img_7269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadasepamdipu/img_7270.jpg\" alt=\"img_7270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadasepamdipu/img_7271.jpg\" alt=\"img_7271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadasepamdipu/img_7272.jpg\" alt=\"img_7272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadasepamdipu/img_7273.jpg\" alt=\"img_7273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"h